            "review_title": "Review at Am Thuc Ha Noi 58",
            "review_text": "pauladsous\nLausanne, Switzerland8 contributions\n0\nWhen one can't travel North to indulge in Bun Cha & fresh nem ran\nMay 2019 • Solo\nI had done my research and was looking for the best Bun Cha in Da Nang, and while this might not be the absolute bestest it did not disappoint. Kind and friendly owners, efficient service, calm dining room at 17:00 on that Thursday afternoon, I enjoyed my bowl and every noodle and actually asked for extra nuoc mam, but that's just because I'm a salty mama. Right below the Catholic cathedral, Don't miss it for your Bunch Cha fix\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 24, 2019",
