            "review_text": "Thomas@TomVoyage\nBangkok, Thailand1059 contributions\n0\nJust That Little Something is Missing\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nIt could be as simple as not enough salt (it definitely is not the lack of MSG) or a herb or a cooking technique - the food just doesn't taste as Vietnamese as it goes in Hanoi.\n\nThe restaurant is clean, the staff as indifferent as I have come to expect during Tet, the bathrooms...I won't go there.\n\nIn a nutshell. Bland food, noted staff, bad hygiene.\n\nDo again? I don't think so.\nRead more\nWritten February 8, 2019",
